# 131k-attempt-blocker
owner: turbofit-memory-monitor · cadence: human phrase · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a watch that warns when a large candidate is queued or launched for 131K on this 32 GB box?**

## Prompt
Check active turbofit servers and queued candidate artifacts. If any artifact >12GB is running or queued for 131K, write a blocker note to wiki/concepts/131k-deferred-candidates.md and surface a warning.

## Evidence
> Dirk Q3_K_XL (13GB) + KV@131K q8 (~8GB) = OOM
> Tiel-Coder Q4_K_XL (22GB) + KV@131K q8 (~8GB) = OOM
> Nail Q4_K_XL (20.8GB) + KV@131K q8 (~8GB) = OOM
